          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "In darts, 'The Madhouse' is slang for Double 1 (worth 2 points). It earned its reputation because once a player is on 2, any single 1 or miss inside busts the score to zero, leaving them trapped in a mental and mathematical loop that is notoriously difficult to escape."
